            "n": "7",
            "src": {
              "accented": [
                "aśvā̍vatī̱r goma̍tīr na u̱ṣāso̍",
                "vī̱rava̍tī̱ḥ sada̍mu-cchantu bha̱drāḥ |",
                "ghṛ̱taṁ duhā̍nā vi̱śvata̱ḥ prapī̍nā",
                "yū̱yaṁ pā̍ta sva̱stibhi̱ḥ sadā̍ naḥ ||7||"
              ],
              "lines": [
                "aśvāvatīr gomatīr na uṣāso",
                "vīravatīḥ sadamu-cchantu bhadrāḥ |",
                "ghṛtaṁ duhānā viśvataḥ prapīnā",
                "yūyaṁ pāta svastibhiḥ sadā naḥ ||7||"
              ]
            },
            "svaraRegister": "attested",
            "t": "verse",
            "text": "aśvāvatīr gomatīr na  uṣāso\nvīravatīs sadamu-cchantu bhadrāḥ ।\nghṛtan duhānā viśvataḥ prapīnā\nyūyam pāta svastibhis sadā naḥ ॥7॥",
            "translation": {
              "en": "May the dawns, rich in horses, rich in cattle, rich in heroes, and always auspicious shine for us. May all of you who yield ghee, overflowing from all sides, always protect us with auspicious blessings. taittirīya āraṇyaka ekāgnikāṇḍa 2.6., āpastamba mantrapāṭha 2.6.12"
            },
